    "Text": "As the actions from <sheet(ClassJob,<sheet(ClassJob,IntegerParameter(1),29)>,0)> may also be used when playing <sheet(ClassJob,IntegerParameter(1),0)>, transferring these settings will allow you to readily play in a similar fashion.\n\nThis option is recommended for those who have little or no experience with <sheet(ClassJob,IntegerParameter(1),0)>.\n\nShould you require time to consider, this window will open again the next time you change your job to <sheet(ClassJob,IntegerParameter(1),0)>.\n※This window will no longer display after progressing through job quests."
